{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_st_13-02",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "st_13-02",
  "title": "窺冠冕者",
  "storyCode": "13-9",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_13-02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "818cbca7f10d9c832552788bc50805b536f797cb85602955eb64490ee33daf3b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "W回來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "還沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "她這次行動所花費的時間，已經超出了最壞的估算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "夜鶯的情況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "不是很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "雖然麗茲的狀態前所未有地穩定，但她體內源石含量的指標正在升高，甚至極有可能影響到了她的痛覺神經。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這不會是正常的感染現象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "也許是薩卡茲在戰場上布置的巫術裝置，或是死魂靈的呢喃……我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我沒法對麗茲說，“我對你的痛苦感同身受”。我確實不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "可她昨天很開心地告訴我，她已經很長時間沒在睡夢中有痛苦的感覺了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你在猶豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "自從你獨自從赦罪師那裡回來後，你一直在猶豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你記得當初你申請隨行來到倫蒂尼姆的理由嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "“治癒麗茲”，凱爾希醫生，我從未對這個目標有片刻的猶疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "哪怕並不清楚她病情的確切狀態，我們也都知道所謂的“治癒”意味著什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "要做的事情是不會變的……我清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我信任你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你看待夜鶯的眼神，並非只有悲憫。不只你是她的醫生，她也在治療你的恐懼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "夜鶯固然身體上有些缺陷，但她是“使徒”的一員，是你的同行者，而不是需要保護的嬌懦花朵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "赦罪師的秘密確實令人反胃。但也許，只有直面最深遠的那個可憎的潛藏者，我們才有揭開真相的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我知道你有些不安，閃靈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "但是正如我們合作之初所言，如果你們需要，羅德島會提供幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "——感謝你，凱爾希醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……麗茲醒了，我去接她回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "閃靈，不用這麼照顧我，我沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲，我們剛才也聊了聊你的病情，有一些數值……不算太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "如今倫蒂尼姆的周圍已經成了戰場，有些東西對你的身體產生了影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我和凱爾希醫生正在商量下一步的行動計劃。這裡也只是個臨時的落腳點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "閃靈……過來。靠過來些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "看看你，別露出這種表情。你本來已經下定決心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我們沒辦法一直逃下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "既然如此，那我們還不如堂堂正正地站在他們面前，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我知道你會陪著我，所以我寧願留在這裡，我寧願更主動一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "堅強一點，閃靈，自從上次你和他們見過一面後，你眉頭總是皺著。你是在緊張嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "對了，我剛剛在樹下睡著了……做了一個夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "那時候我們好像還很小，我們在一條溪流中行走……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "溪水沒到了我們的小腿，很涼，但也很舒服。我們誰也沒有說話，我們只是安靜地向前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "然後我就醒了，看到了一隻奇怪的羽獸不停地啄自己的羽毛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "它遍體鱗傷，快要把自己啄得渾身是血……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "它蜷縮在巢穴中哀求地看著我，但眼珠中流淌出的不是眼淚，而是白色的蠟油……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "連它凌亂的絨羽都被凝固住了，它死前還在鳴叫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "一種奇怪的音律，聽上去就像是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "*古老的薩卡茲語*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你引我至此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而我來接你回家，麗茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Mon3tr！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（高昂的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "結構真脆弱，看來特雷西斯的劍比想像中還要鋒利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "閃靈，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲，沒事，他傷不到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你退步了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "這樣會讓我很頭疼，將你的肉體重新調回巔峰的狀態會佔用很多的實驗時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你竟然願意離開你那污穢的巢穴……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "看來有什麼事情令你也感到焦急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我們已經來到了那扇大門之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "哪怕尚只是輕叩大門，就已經大大加快了我們實驗的進度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "最後的儀式你必須出席——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Mon3tr，熔毀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（憤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "五分鐘就足夠，薩盧斯，用生命阻止她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "別讓他們打擾我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "當然，首領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（痛苦的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……黑色的法術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "那是……阿米婭的？你們把阿米婭怎麼了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你們沒有打敗阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "我本可以將魔王無恙地獻給首領，可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "不過沒關係，只是看見，也足夠讓贗品更進一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "所以，小怪物，不要妄圖打擾首領，你現在得陪我去其他地方老實待著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（憤怒的哀鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Mon3tr！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "凱爾希醫生，你還不能亂動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我說過，你我再見面只會是在戰場上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "哦？那為何此刻還要隱藏自己的劍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你離家時，曾立誓斷絕家族的血統，我無時無刻不期盼你回歸家族履行誓言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我給了你時間，你卻一次次讓我失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "本來，我們該誕下下一個我。那將是近百年來，最空靈的血脈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "唔……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "……唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "犀利，但雜質頗多。你的靈魂是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "離開我們的時間裡，你難道還自以為擁有希望嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我不會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "任你擺布！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "……哦？你確實是意料之外的作品，遠超我的預期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "明明只是一副軀殼，也能觸及“我”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "閃靈，趁現在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我……我撐不住太久！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "夜鶯，停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這是陷阱，他在等著你們的法術共鳴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你我都清楚命運將指引我們去往何處，渾然不自知的唯有可憐的囚籠自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "蔑視血統、對抗命運注定是徒勞。無人可以否定我們血統所饋贈的天理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我替你完成你所遲疑的事情，為囚籠鑿開一道縫隙……跟我一起進入囚籠，我會修正你錯誤的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "想清楚你的選擇……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "*古老的薩卡茲名*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "見過……痛苦……你……眼淚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "意外總會帶來驚喜。你本可以就此停止探索的腳步，但你不忍摧毀空殼中的矇昧的意識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "……於是你在空殼中縫入了記憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "她是麗茲。她不該……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "這是你的自由，你用“麗茲”來為填充的意識命名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我每天都在重複著同一個夢，夢到我們小時候手牽手在溪流中行走……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "然後我就飛了起來，越飛越高，可你拉不住我，我在雲端上看到你哭泣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "每當我想要回到你的身邊時，我都會在疼痛中驚醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我因感受到你的痛苦而疼痛，我想替你分擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "只要你告訴我你為何而痛苦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "奎薩辛娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "奎薩辛娜，這個名字意味著“不允分離的希望”，我們的宿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "她因為你的一時善意而自責，她認為所有的錯誤都來自她自己，可憐的“麗茲”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我已經拋棄了這個罪惡的名字，我現在是閃靈，也只會是閃靈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "是嗎？你自認可以反抗家族千年以來的命運？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我拭目以待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "奎薩辛娜，對不起，我不是故意要冒險走進河水裡救它……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "但我不能眼睜睜地看著它這樣死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "你的家人把它作為禮物送給我時，我就喜歡上它了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "它喜歡自由地飛翔，可是一旦它離我太遠就好像失去了生命，總是墜入河裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "你說我昨天也做過同樣的事……可我完全不記得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "但我會聽你的話，把它裝進籠子裡，我會保護好它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "請不要生氣，我向你保證，這樣的傻事再也不會發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "囚籠終於接受了自己的使命，你也認清了自己的宿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你為她填補的碎片與謊言越多，她的困惑與痛苦也就越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我為她揭開了塵封的碎片，她的甦醒不可逆轉，她最終會痛苦地崩解自己無根的意識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我不會讓這一切發生，父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我會親手結束我們的罪孽，麗茲會被“治癒”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "然後呢？你所害怕的不正是重拾真相的她嗎，親愛的姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "這才是你可悲猶疑的源頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我容忍你帶著容器流浪，容忍你繼續加固這脆弱的囚籠……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "因為我相信你會用盡一切去愛護它，而你從不令我失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "最終你會帶著囚籠回到我的身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你確實這麼做了。看吧，她甚至試圖囚禁我，為打敗我創造機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你叛逆的對她的愛，和她對命運的抗爭意識，可悲地，成了又一道催化劑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "——連她自己找到的希望都要利用？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "閃靈？你在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我能感受到你的氣息，但是我看不見你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我在這，麗茲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "她聽不見你的聲音，我們行走在她破碎的意識裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "——囚籠的內部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "閃靈……我的腦海裡一直迴響著一個會刺痛我的名字和模糊的問題，但是我怎麼也想不起來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "等我們離開這裡，我就想起來了也說不定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我發現自己能夠分享他人的痛苦來減緩他們生命的凋零。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麗茲？",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "你說我們會去很遠的地方尋找治療我的辦法，或許我也能沿途治療那些感到痛苦的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "無序的破碎記憶正在淹沒她，她遲早會迷失其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "或許瘋掉，又或許在那之前就結束自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "但你知道解決的辦法，我教過你，奎薩辛娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "拔出你的劍，在此徹底斬斷你血親的軀體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我們的靈魂將以你的劍為橋梁，重新締結，而你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "會孕育。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "會誕下亙古的權柄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "這是你無法逃避的宿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "與我合一，用你血親的殘軀滋養她本應破碎的意識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲，原諒我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "終於，奎薩辛娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "閃靈，我更喜歡你現在這個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我好像睡了很久，在無數的碎片裡迷了路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "但是我聽到了你的聲音，你指引我找到了一處被漫漫碎片掩埋的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "在那裡，我挖到了回憶的碎片……我還，沒有想起全部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "但我重新記起了那個早該回答你的問題……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我早就原諒了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "甚至還在你狠心封印那間實驗室裡的一切記憶之前……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "所以，我對你的擅作主張可是很生氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "“麗茲”，我一直很喜歡你為我取的這個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "不要逃開我獨自承擔一切，我們約定好了要共同面對——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "一場悲劇，但結局總是固定的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你殺死我，令你成為下一段血脈的溫床，或是，你眼睜睜看著我帶走她，而後你溺死在懊悔之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "都是一樣的，姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "首領，我們得撤退了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "奇美拉，你還有什麼血脈沒有觸及過？展現給我看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "你能多少次將血收回身體，你又能多少次曉諭自己的命運？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（疑惑的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr？",
      "speakerId": "npc_10003_1",
      "text": "（憤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（興奮的高鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你對於這個小怪物的模仿很拙劣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "是新生後的你實力大不如前，還是眾魔敬愛的凱爾希勳爵比想像中受傷更深？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr？",
      "speakerId": "npc_10003_1",
      "text": "（不屑的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "奎薩圖什塔。另一部分，選擇了你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "你們會帶給他什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "奎薩圖什塔的名諱即是答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）“不滅的希望”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "奎薩辛娜，囚籠的意識已經甦醒，繼續把她留在你的身邊，她只會如同清晨的露珠……蒸發，凋亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我會帶走她，我會幫你維持，我會幫你彌補——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我會把囚籠鑄成王冠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "然後，你會是，我們會是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "永恆的魔王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "不要追趕，沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "馬上清點損失，準備轉移，傷員們的情況還不穩定，但這裡已經暴露了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "凱爾希醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "幹員夜鶯是羅德島醫療部的一員，對於她的挾持和傷害不會被我們允許。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "但任何輕率的舉動都可能讓她陷入更大的危險，畢竟我們需要面對的對手……是一位覬覦了王冠數千年的，不滅的“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "奎薩圖什塔。叩捶門扉者，篡王之王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我留意到了赦罪師的威脅，即使在巴別塔時期，數次舉措皆徒勞無功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "特雷西斯把他們掩飾得很好，讓人們以為他們只是攝政王的近衛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "……請不用擔心，我知道我們現在該做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "你比我想像中冷靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "你們有什麼計劃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "麗茲她……自己做出了選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "即使是我也從來不敢想的一個選擇，大膽，冒進，但卻是最有效的手段。看來害怕失去、害怕死亡的始終是我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我要做的，呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_147_shining_1",
      "text": "是追上她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……我相信你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，阿米婭呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "阿米婭和博士也同樣遭遇了赦罪師的襲擊，現在他們和Logos在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "阿米婭被某種巫術影響了，那個叫薩盧斯的人試圖直接奪取魔王的力量，她失敗了，但阿米婭現在的狀態……很奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "她陷入了昏迷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……阿米婭與“魔王”的聯繫正在加強，我們只能相信她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "還有些額外情報，我們在戰場上發現了數座血魔的法陣，還伴隨著一些來自歷史的“幻象”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "text": "博士提到了，建造法陣的源石結晶，很“特殊”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "“特殊”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "至於您，變形者閣下，感謝您這次的援助，您想從我們這裡索求什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "我們索求變化。索求砥礪。索求意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "為漫長無序的生命尋找意義。你們展示給我們，我們去證明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "……就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "通知可露希爾和費斯特，把這裡徹底清理乾淨，我們三小時後出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "給W留個訊息，按原定計劃，前往布倫特伍德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我們……確實要加快腳步了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂！諾威爾叔叔！我的眼鏡片又掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我和你說了很多遍，你的耳朵太軟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "你一覺得眼鏡要往下滑，就去掰眼鏡的架子，鏡架一變形，眼鏡片當然也固定不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "給我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是你給我的這副眼鏡太重了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過，我找到了個更好的方法，你看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "……你能看見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能看見，真的能看見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要這樣，對著陽光——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "行了，孩子，你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣，我說的沒錯吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "諾威爾叔叔平時老皺著眉頭，都看不見有趣的東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "……我什麼也看不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "不過，我在書上看過，在東方的大炎，有一個被稱作“一葉障目”的故事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不聽，不聽！諾威爾叔叔還是這麼沒意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "諾威爾先生，看上去你和孩子不怎麼處得來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "塔露拉啊，忙完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "剛才那個故事，我曾經跟我的兒子講過……不過，他也不喜歡聽我講故事，或許我不是擅長講故事的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "你的經歷確實很豐富，哪怕我們是從隻言片語中得知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "一位備受壓迫的維多利亞小市民，被奪去了店鋪的驗光師，在戰爭中流亡至此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "他同情同樣備受歧視的感染者們，所以選擇加入他們的隊伍，提供一些力所能及的微小幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "自從結識你以來，諾威爾先生，你展現出了令人尊敬的品格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "但正因如此……我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "……塔露拉小姐，請有話直說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "我只是好奇，一位長生者為何要隱藏身份屈尊來做如此微不足道的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "我察覺到了。當然，比我最壞的打算要好不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "但你……你可以否認，然後我們相安無事。但我會告訴九。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我不準備否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "其實不少與我熟識的維多利亞人了解我的身份……我只是習慣了避免貿然嚇到同行的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "但是塔露拉小姐，我也想糾正你的說法，我並非“屈尊”來做這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "除了活得更長以外，我想我沒有比常人更獨特的天賦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "每個長生者獲取壽命的方式不盡相同，他們所利用的源石技藝也多種多樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "但他們並非總是風雲人物，塔露拉小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "不過，塔露拉小姐……我倒更好奇你的故事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "紅龍的末裔，整合運動的創始者，在烏薩斯掀起感染者運動的領袖。你竟然還對所謂的“長生者”如此敏銳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "……你到底是誰，諾威爾先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "一百五十年前，我為我的第三個兒子講述了我在炎國遊歷時聽來的寓言故事，他不耐煩地離開了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "而當我站在他孫女的孫女面前時，我又一次成為一個龐大家族中的陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "懷著憤怒與痛苦，我徹底放棄了親情與愛情，試圖找出隱藏在維多利亞的、操縱我命運的惡徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我花費了上百年研究……研究“長生者”“神”“掌控者”“古老者”，研究我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我嘗試過成為貴族體系的受益者，我嘗試過磨礪自己的源石技藝，我嘗試過累積財富換取秘密……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我嘗試了你能想到的所有途徑去接近真相，但無一例外，我都失敗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我沒能當上貴族，也不是什麼富豪。我只有一家小門店……是真的。而論起戰鬥能力，我甚至未必能贏過Guard先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "時間只教會了我認清自己毫無天賦的事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "一個普通人的故事，塔露拉小姐，我可以毫無保留地分享給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "請放心，我對你們毫無惡意，我只是想找到為我降下詛咒的……“命運之手”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "她躲在國家的背後，將君王視作自己的手套，將城邦看作自己的棋盤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "她只是冷冷看著被稱作“維多利亞”的沙盤上的一切。必要時，連“維多利亞”都可以被毀壞重建，然後換一面旗幟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我怎麼能相信，這樣一場荒唐的動亂中，沒有她的身影？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "她一定藏在公爵之間。看著薩卡茲和維多利亞人相互殘殺。流血，犧牲，在她的維度裡都只是無情的數值和指標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "也許，你也被那樣一雙“手”擺弄過，你身上畢竟流著皇室的血。她沒有理由放過你，也沒有理由放過阿利斯泰爾的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "……我？我認識的是另外一個陰謀家。他不配稱神，也操縱不了我的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "但他們就是以這種方式生活的，塔露拉小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "我想知道怎麼殺死他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "或者，怎麼殺死我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "時間不早了，我還得去修好小蘇珊娜的眼鏡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "諾威爾先生，你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "塔露拉小姐，之所以願意對你說這些，之所以加入整合運動——原諒我的私心吧——是因為我多活了百來年磨鍊出的直覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "你也曾反抗那樣一個自以為既定的宿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1066_1",
      "text": "你們這群人，都曾反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
